<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Entrar | Unio</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap">
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        body {
            background: #07080F;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .login-wrapper {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 960px;
            min-height: 560px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
        }

        .login-left {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0C0D18 0%, #0f1435 100%);
            padding: 60px 48px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .login-left::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -120px;
            right: -80px;
            width: 360px;
            height: 360px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(61,114,255,0.14) 0%, transparent 68%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .login-left::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -60px;
            left: -40px;
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(107,154,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .login-left > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .brand-mark {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 20px rgba(91,143,255,0.5));
        }

        .brand-name {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            letter-spacing: -0.04em;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .brand-name em {
            font-style: normal;
            color: #6B9AFF;
        }

        .login-tagline-wrap {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 32px 0 24px;
        }

        .login-tagline h2 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            line-height: 1.25;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .login-tagline h2 span {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8BB0FF, #3D72FF);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .login-tagline p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.36);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.65;
            max-width: 300px;
        }

        .login-right {
            background: #0C0D18;
            padding: 60px 48px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .login-right h3 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .login-right .sub {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.32);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .form-group { margin-bottom: 16px; }

        .form-label {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.38);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .form-control {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 7px;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 11px 14px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-family: inherit;
            width: 100%;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: rgba(61,114,255,0.5);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(61,114,255,0.1);
        }

        .form-control::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }

        .form-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .form-row label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.32);
            font-size: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .form-row label input { accent-color: #3D72FF; }

        .form-row a {
            color: rgba(61,114,255,0.75);
            font-size: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .form-row a:hover { color: #6B9AFF; }

        .btn-login {
            width: 100%;
            background: #3D72FF;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 7px;
            padding: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .btn-login:hover {
            background: #5585ff;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .alert-danger {
            background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.25);
            color: #f87171;
            border-radius: 7px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .login-wrapper { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin: 20px; }
            .login-left { display: none; }
            .login-right { padding: 40px 28px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="login-wrapper">
    <div class="login-left">
        <div class="brand">
            <svg class="unio-mark-svg-lg" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                <defs>
                    <linearGradient id="unio-g-login" x1="4" y1="13" x2="36" y2="13" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                        <stop stop-color="#4F7FFF"/>
                        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#8BB0FF"/>
                    </linearGradient>
                </defs>
                <path d="M4 13 C4 32 36 32 36 13" stroke="url(#unio-g-login)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
                <circle cx="4"  cy="13" r="3.5" fill="#4F7FFF"/>
                <circle cx="36" cy="13" r="3.5" fill="#8BB0FF"/>
                <circle cx="20" cy="30.5" r="2.8" fill="url(#unio-g-login)"/>
            </svg>
            <svg class="unio-wordmark-lg" viewBox="0 0 72 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Unio">
                <path d="M2,30 L2,10 C2,2 20,2 20,10 L20,30" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <path d="M24,30 L24,15 C24,9 42,9 42,15 L42,30" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <line x1="47" y1="14" x2="47" y2="30" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <circle cx="47" cy="9" r="1.8" fill="white"/>
                <circle cx="61" cy="20" r="9" stroke="#6B9AFF" stroke-width="2.2" fill="none"/>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="login-tagline-wrap">
        <div class="login-tagline">
            <h2>Inteligência<br><span>para quem lidera pessoas.</span></h2>
            <p>Gestão humana com clareza, dados e decisão.</p>
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="login-right">
        <h3>Bem-vindo de volta</h3>
        <p class="sub">Entre com suas credenciais para acessar a plataforma</p>

        {% if error %}
            <div class="alert-danger">{{ error.messageKey|trans(error.messageData, 'security') }}</div>
        {% endif %}

        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_login') }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value="{{ csrf_token('authenticate') }}">

            <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label" for="email">E-mail</label>
                <input class="form-control" id="email" type="email" name="email"
                       value="{{ last_username }}" placeholder="seu@email.com"
                       autocomplete="email" autofocus required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label" for="password">Senha</label>
                <input class="form-control" id="password" type="password" name="password"
                       placeholder="••••••••" autocomplete="current-password" required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
                <label>
                    <input type="checkbox" name="_remember_me">
                    Lembrar-me
                </label>
                <a href="#">Esqueci a senha</a>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn-login">Entrar na plataforma</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
